  "description": "Duke Aden de Biffleten is feared across the empire—a terrifying monster whose gaze is said to have killed people. Any woman would dread becoming his bride, yet Elyn de Arlen steps forward, compelled by a prophetic dream in which they are wed. Shunned and mistreated by her house, she sees this marriage as her escape. But that escape leads to a frozen, perilous land, where she must avoid the duke’s eyes. Can she truly survive as his wife, or has she doomed herself to live with this monster?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
